   "title": "Find r",
   "text": "\\[\\begin{aligned}&\\frac{a_6}{a_3}=r^3=\\frac{3/32}{3/4}=\\frac{1}{8}\\Rightarrow r=\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\\]",
