   "id": "s2",
   "title": "Use Sₙ = a₁(1 − rⁿ)/(1 − r)",
   "text": "\\[\\begin{aligned}&S_6=\\frac{3\\left(1-\\frac{1}{64}\\right)}{1-\\frac{1}{2}}=6\\cdot\\frac{63}{64}=\\textcolor{#047857}{\\mathbf{\\frac{189}{32}}}\\end{aligned}\\]",
